sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent
    participant G as Gate
    U->>A: scientific prompt
    A->>A: recall and plan
    loop up to three cycles
        A->>G: freeze and check
        alt accepted
            G-->>A: accepted
        else unmet
            G-->>A: findings
            Note right of A: fix and freeze again
        end
    end
    A-->>U: result with evidence level
